<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines details 1996 GNP, GDP growth.</title>
<headline>Philippines details 1996 GNP, GDP growth.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Economic and Development Authority of the Philippines on Wednesday announced gross national product (GNP) and gross domesitc product (GDP) growth in 1996 as under (all figures percentage growth over previous year)</p>
<p>					 1996		  1995</p>
<p>GNP				     6.8		   5.0</p>
<p>GDP				     5.5		   4.8</p>
<p>By Expenditure Share:</p>
<p>Personal consumption		4.6		   3.8</p>
<p>Government consumption	    2.9		   5.4</p>
<p>Investments			  16.4		   3.0</p>
<p>Exports				23.9		  12.0</p>
<p>Imports				21.2		  16.0</p>
<p>By Industrial Origin:</p>
<p>Agriculture, fisheries and</p>
<p>forests				 3.1		   0.9</p>
<p>Industry				6.3		   7.0</p>
<p>Services				6.0		   5.0</p>
</text>
